---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Project 100 Million collects and uses the information you provide through this website."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy statement</h1>
      <p class="prose__intro">
        This is a plain-language summary of what information {SITE.name} collects through this
        website and how it is used. We keep it short on purpose.
      </p>

      {/* INTERNAL PLACEHOLDER (not rendered): this privacy copy is a draft. Before launch,
          confirm it reflects the initiative's actual data practices and jurisdiction (PRD §11). */}

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you use the Express Interest form, we collect only the details you enter: your
        organization name, your name, role, and work email, your organization type, and the
        workforce or AI-readiness challenges you describe.
      </p>
      <p>
        We also use privacy-respecting analytics to understand, in aggregate, how the site is used
        (for example, which pages are viewed). This does not
        identify you personally and does not use advertising cookies.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use the information you submit for one purpose: to respond to your interest in
        {SITE.name} and to follow up about participation in the initiative.
      </p>

      <h2>What we don’t do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We do not sell or rent your information.</li>
        <li>We do not share it with third parties except as needed to operate this site and respond to you.</li>
        <li>We do not use it for advertising.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Retention & your choices</h2>
      <p>
        We keep the details you submit only as long as needed to follow up on your interest. You can
        ask us to access, correct, or delete your information at any time by emailing
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about privacy? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="prose__updated">Last updated: {SITE.year}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose h1 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h1);
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
  .prose p,
  .prose ul {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--slate-70);
    max-width: 66ch;
  }
  .prose__intro {
    font-size: var(--fs-lead);
  }
  .prose ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .prose__updated {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--slate-50);
  }
</style>
